{"uid":"e116b66aa236a6d0","name":"Application without an offer explicitly communicates the unavailable state without stale offer data","fullName":"tests.e2e.application.test_application_listing.TestApplicationListing#test_application_no_offer_unavailable_state","historyId":"bf507f9193822805b98eaab94d3e9144","time":{"start":1794550950823,"stop":1794550964381,"duration":13558},"description":"Objective: Dynamically discovered application with authoritative draft-underwriting no-offer state shows no stale offer UI.\nPreconditions: QA contains at least one existing application that satisfies the complete no-offer contract.\nSteps:\n1. Read paginated authoritative listings and prefilter without a fixed application number.\n2. Fetch exact candidate details and select only a record satisfying DRAFT UNDERWRITING NEW_FILE parentDeal null selectedKesefDeal null and explicit offer-free references/documents.\n3. Search and open the discovered application by its API identity.\n4. Revalidate the complete no-offer contract from the navigation-time detail response.\n5. Verify stale offer controls are hidden and the unavailable state is visible.\nExpected: A dynamically discovered existing record satisfies every complete listing/detail no-offer condition before the UI unavailable state is accepted.","descriptionHtml":"<p>Objective: Dynamically discovered application with authoritative draft-underwriting no-offer state shows no stale offer UI.<br />\nPreconditions: QA contains at least one existing application that satisfies the complete no-offer contract.<br />\nSteps:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Read paginated authoritative listings and prefilter without a fixed application number.</li>\n<li>Fetch exact candidate details and select only a record satisfying DRAFT UNDERWRITING NEW_FILE parentDeal null selectedKesefDeal null and explicit offer-free references/documents.</li>\n<li>Search and open the discovered application by its API identity.</li>\n<li>Revalidate the complete no-offer contract from